@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Edit & Resubmit Purchase Request

DEVELOPER OWNER: Doulat
MODULE: Department / Purchase Requests
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Edit a Draft request, or correct a Returned request and
resubmit it, while every earlier submitted snapshot stays
readable.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Requesting Department (original owner / own department; only
Draft or Returned requests)

ROUTE: /Department/PurchaseRequests/Edit/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- GET: load the request only if it belongs to the user’s
  department and Status is Draft or Returned; otherwise
  NotFound/Forbid.
- POST Save: update the current request and its items (the
  request row is the working copy).
- POST Resubmit: Status = Submitted and a NEW
  PurchaseRequestReview with SubmissionNumber + 1 and a
  fresh SubmittedSnapshotJson; never modify earlier review
  rows.
- Notify the Sourcing Officer; audit.

DEPENDENCIES:
PurchaseRequests, PurchaseRequestItems,
PurchaseRequestReviews (SubmittedSnapshotJson), Documents,
Notifications, AuditLogs.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
No dedicated Trello card; part of Doulat’s Department
request module (spec §15.2 / §18.9). A sender edits only
after a return (owner rule).
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Edit & Resubmit Purchase Request";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "My Requests";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Correct a draft, or a request the Sourcing Officer returned, and submit it again. Earlier submissions stay unchanged.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<aside class="pg-note"><strong>Why this request was returned</strong><p>The Sourcing Officer’s return reason and date from the latest PurchaseRequestReview are shown here. Only Draft and Returned requests can be edited; Submitted, Accepted and Rejected requests are read-only.</p></aside>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Request</h2>
    <form class="pg-form">
        <fieldset disabled>
            <div class="pg-form-grid">
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-title-1">Title</label><input id="f-title-1" type="text" /></div>
                <div class="pg-field pg-field-wide"><label for="f-justification-2">Justification</label><textarea id="f-justification-2" rows="4"></textarea></div>
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-priority-3">Priority</label><select id="f-priority-3"><option>Normal</option><option>Low</option><option>High</option><option>Urgent</option></select></div>
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-needed-by-4">Needed by</label><input id="f-needed-by-4" type="date" /></div>
            </div>
        </fieldset>
    </form>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-requested-items-editable">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-requested-items-editable">Requested items (editable)</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Item / service</th><th scope="col">Specifications</th><th scope="col">Quantity</th><th scope="col">Unit</th><th scope="col">Actions</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="5"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"Items of this request are not loaded."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Attachments</h2>
    <form class="pg-form">
        <fieldset disabled>
            <div class="pg-form-grid">
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-add-supporting-documents-5">Add supporting documents</label><input id="f-add-supporting-documents-5" type="file" /><small class="pg-hint">Earlier attachments stay linked to the request.</small></div>
            </div>
        </fieldset>
    </form>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-previous-submissions-read-only">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-previous-submissions-read-only">Previous submissions (read-only)</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Submission #</th><th scope="col">Submitted</th><th scope="col">Items / quantities at that time</th><th scope="col">Officer decision</th><th scope="col">Comment</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="5"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No earlier submissions loaded."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Resubmit</h2>
    <form class="pg-form">
        <fieldset disabled>
            <div class="pg-actions"><button type="submit" class="pg-btn pg-btn-primary">Resubmit to Sourcing Officer</button><button type="button" class="pg-btn">Save changes as draft</button><span class="pg-hint">Not implemented yet — nothing is saved.</span></div>
        </fieldset>
    </form>
</section>

<nav class="pg-links" aria-label="Related pages">
    <ul>
        <li><a asp-area="Department" asp-controller="PurchaseRequests" asp-action="Details">Request details &amp; history</a></li>
        <li><a asp-area="Department" asp-controller="PurchaseRequests" asp-action="Index">Back to my requests</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>
